  "schema:description": "The Geomagnetic Indices Bulletin is a one page sheet containing the magnetic indices Kp, Ap, Cp, An, As, Am and the provisional aa indices. The bulletin is published monthly.\n\nPurpose: Solar-Terrestrial and Space Weather Research",
